 justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .diet-image img {\n    max-width: 100%;\n    max-height: 100%;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n  }\n  .key-table td {\n    padding: 10px 12px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n  .key-table td:first-child {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    width: 120px;\n    text-align: center;\n    background-color: #fafafa;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n  }\n  .key-table td:last-child {\n    vertical-align: middle;\n  }\n  .notes-list {\n    list-style: none;\n    padding: 0;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .notes-list li {\n    padding: 6px 0;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n  .section-divider {\n    margin: 5px 0;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<h1>怀孕第 2 个月要做的事</h1>\n\n<!-- 孕检 Section -->\n<div class=\"section-header section-header-blue\">孕检</div>\n<table class=\"check-table\">\n  <tr>\n    <th style=\"background:#d6eaf8;\">孕周</th>\n    <th style=\"background:#d6eaf8;\">检查项目</th>\n    <th style=\"background:#d6eaf8;\">检查目的</th>\n    <th style=\"background:#d6eaf8;\">注意事项</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td rowspan=\"2\">孕 6-9 周</td>\n    <td>抽血</td>\n    <td>看胎心、胎芽</td>\n    <td rowspan=\"2\">不建议太早去，太小不容易检查到，<br>第一次 B 超建议准爸爸陪同</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>B 超</td>\n    <td>确认宫内孕</td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n<!-- 饮食指南 Section -->\n<div class=\"section-header section-header-yellow\">饮食指南</div>\n<table class=\"diet-table\">\n  <tr>\n    <td>重要营养</td>\n    <td>叶酸、维 B6、C（缓解孕吐，预防妊娠期牙龈炎）</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>饮食重点</td>\n    <td>少食多餐，饮食均衡</td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n<div class=\"diet-content-row\">\n  <div class=\"diet-text\">\n    ①食补：鱼肉、鸡肉、芹菜、南瓜、西红柿、小白菜、草莓、金桔<br>\n    ②推荐食谱：番茄鸡蛋面、醋溜白菜、豌豆炒虾仁、清蒸鲈鱼、<br>\n    彩椒炒藕片、蒜蓉粉丝蒸丝瓜、酸奶水果沙拉、香橙苹果汁<br>\n    ③饮食禁忌：不吃保健品如天麻、人参、西洋参、灵芝、胖大海\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"diet-image\">\n    <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:120px;height:120px;border-radius:50%;background:#f0f0f0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;color:#999;text-align:center;\">\n      [图片：食物拼盘]\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- 重点事项 Section -->\n<div class=\"section-header section-header-orange\">重点事项</div>\n<table class=\"key-table\">\n  <tr>\n    <td>胎儿变化</td>\n    <td>心脏有规律地跳动，四肢开始长出，眼鼻清晰可辨</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>孕妈变化</td>\n    <td>子宫增大如鹅蛋大小，阴道分泌物增多，恶心、厌食、呕吐</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td rowspan=\"4\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;\">注意事项</td>\n    <td>①避免尿路感染，多喝水，勤换内裤，每天用温水冲洗外阴</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>②可以使用护肤品，不要用功效型产品如美白、祛斑等</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>③避免用力的动作，不提重物、不干重活</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>④这个时期可能出现早孕反应身体不适，不擅自用药需遵医嘱</td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n</body>\n</html>",
